{"last_link_id": 6, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["开源地址：\n\nhttps://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice\nhttps://github.com/Saganaki22/ComfyUI-OmniVoice-TTS\n\n\n声音设计-使用说明（官方）\n\n声音设计模式允许你通过说话人属性（instruct 参数）来描述想要的声音——无需参考音频。模型会实时生成匹配的声音。\n\n模型会自动检测 instruct 文本的语言并在内部进行标准化——你可以用英文、中文或中英混合来编写。\n\n支持的属性\n\n性别：\n英文\t中文\nmale\t男\nfemale\t女\n\n年龄：\n英文\t中文\nchild\t儿童\nteenager\t少年\nyoung adult\t青年\nmiddle-aged\t中年\nelderly\t老年\n\n音高：\n英文\t中文\nvery low pitch\t极低音调\nlow pitch\t低音调\nmoderate pitch\t中音调\nhigh pitch\t高音调\nvery high pitch\t极高音调\n\n风格：\n英文\t中文\nwhisper\t耳语\n\n\n英语口音：\n仅当合成文本为英语时生效。\n\namerican accent\nbritish accent\naustralian accent\ncanadian accent\nindian accent\nchinese accent\nkorean accent\njapanese accent\nportuguese accent\nrussian accent\n\n\n中文方言：\n仅当合成文本为中文时生效。\n\n河南话\n陕西话\n四川话\n贵州话\n云南话\n桂林话\n济南话\n石家庄话\n甘肃话\n宁夏话\n青岛话\n东北话\n\n编写 instruct 字符串：\n属性之间用逗号分隔（英文逗号 , 或中文逗号 ， 均可——模型会自动纠正不匹配的符号）。\n\n英文示例  ：\"female, young adult, high pitch, british accent\"\n中文示例  ： \"女，青年，高音调，四川话\"\n混合示例（自动标准化）： \"female, young adult, 四川话\"\n\n使用技巧\n跨类别自由组合：\"male, elderly, low pitch, whisper\"\n交给模型决定：省略你不在乎的属性，模型会自动补全剩余部分。例如仅写 \"female\" 也是有效的。\n不区分大小写：\"Male\"、\"MALE\" 和 \"male\" 均被接受，代码会自动转换为小写。\n口音 vs 方言：英语口音仅作用于英语语音，中文方言仅作用于中文语音。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [546.5238647460938, 1382.77490234375], "pos": [-311.6857604980469, -125.7325439453125], "id": 6, "properties": {}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [5], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["今天天气好好，我们一起去吃火锅要得不？"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [287.8450012207031, 588.0366821289062], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [1], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["OmniVoice", "今天天气好好哦，我们一起去吃火锅要得不？", "女，青年，低音调，四川话", 32, 1, 0, "auto", "auto", "auto", 85, "fixed", false], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 5, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "voice_instruct"}, "name": "voice_instruct", "link": 6, "label": "voice_instruct", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "voice_instruct"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "steps"}, {"widget": {"name": "speed"}, "name": "speed", "label": "speed", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "speed"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "label": "duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "dtype"}, "name": "dtype", "label": "dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "dtype"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention"}, "name": "attention", "label": "attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "OmniVoiceVoiceDesignTTS", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [468.0063781738281, 512.2073974609375], "pos": [755.0515747070312, 575.4581909179688], "id": 3, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "OmniVoiceVoiceDesignTTS"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#